@startuml estados-request-flow
!include ../../../docs/diagramas/tema-plataforma.iuml
hide empty description
title $I_MAQUINA Máquina de estado sample-solution-<stage>-request-flow

state "$I_LAMBDA Validate\nTask: Lambda validate" as Validate <<inicial>>
state "$I_LAMBDA Persist\nTask: Lambda persist" as Persist <<ativo>>
state "$I_LAMBDA Notify\nTask: Lambda notify" as Notify <<ativo>>
state "$I_DLQ SendToDeadLetterQueue\nTask: arn:aws:states:::sqs:sendMessage" as SendToDeadLetterQueue <<espera>>
state "RequestFailed\nFail: Error RequestFailed" as RequestFailed <<erro>>

[*] --> Validate : StartExecution da api (nome requestId)\nou do reprocess (nome requestId-attempt)
Validate --> Persist : RequestContext com signature e payloadBytes
Persist --> Notify : RequestContext
Notify --> [*] : SUCCEEDED
Validate -[#C62828]-> SendToDeadLetterQueue : Catch States.ALL\nResultPath $.error
Persist -[#C62828]-> SendToDeadLetterQueue : Catch States.ALL\nResultPath $.error
Notify -[#C62828]-> SendToDeadLetterQueue : Catch States.ALL\nResultPath $.error
SendToDeadLetterQueue -[#C62828]-> RequestFailed : MessageBody.$ = $
RequestFailed -[#C62828]-> [*] : FAILED

note right of Validate
  Nenhum estado tem Retry: o primeiro erro
  vai direto para a DLQ, e a nova tentativa
  é do reprocess (ADR 0007).
end note

legend right
    <b>Leitura</b>
    <back:#E3F2FD>    </back> Estado inicial
    <back:#E8F5E9>    </back> Passo de negócio
    <back:#FFF3E0>    </back> Integração direta com o SQS
    <back:#FFEBEE>    </back> Fim com falha
    Seta vermelha: caminho de falha
endlegend
@enduml
